{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_vigna_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_vigna_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"該做的事","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_vigna_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"65688f9303e1bdbd1713be81ec1a9d6892b3a696a4bbbaf3d63466caed33a4f1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"紅豆急著在完成任務後前往參加演唱會，但現實卻事與願違，她的選擇是......","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 红豆"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"閃開閃開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑，乖乖被我解決掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，紅豆，別衝這麼前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆今天怎麼這麼興奮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道？我們停靠的城市今晚有一場搖滾演唱會的樣子，紅豆很期待的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，難怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧？好了，趕緊跟上她，要是出事了可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，紅豆，雖然理解你的心情，但是別太興奮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好的，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，我也不是批評你，只是提醒你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你做得很不錯，雖然有點急躁，但沒有喪失判斷力，該做的也做了，成長了啊，紅豆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我可是每天都在鍛煉自己的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，了不起，我在你這個年紀的時候可沒有你這麼刻苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不過看你今天的勁頭，今天的演唱會很厲害嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是我相當喜歡的一支樂隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我們停靠城市時正好遇上演唱會的機會可是很少見的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，搖滾的演唱會現場和聽唱片感覺可是完全不一樣的，我建議你們也一起來哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我就算了，對我來說，搖滾太吵鬧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我也差不多，不過為了我們紅豆的演唱會，我們兩個也努力一點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"說得沒錯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，這群傢伙居然還懂得埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺這種規模的獸群應該有個首領之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不過應該不在我們追趕的這一群裡，不然我們不會到現在都沒有發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦？我們要在周邊搜索一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一隻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，應該沒有了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，算了吧，今天就先收工吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有找到它們的首領，今天各組一起把它們的數量削減了這麼多，也一時半會掀不起風浪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，也是，而且說不定從一開始就沒有首領呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，紅豆，你的演唱會來得及嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是下午2點10分，唔，回到艦內報告大概要一個小時，然後去城裡要一個小時，演唱會開始是下午5點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"還來得及！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，我們回去報告吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"其他組呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"其他組也已經順利完成各自負責的部分返回了，你們是最後一組了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"那這樣任務就算完成了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，確實是這樣，只不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"C組的人在驅趕野獸時，遭到了似乎是它們領袖的野獸襲擊，對方數量不少，所以C組選擇了撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧，我就說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"得意什麼，我也想到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們與市政府簽訂的契約上明確規定了我們需要排除這群騷擾居民外出的野獸的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說我們還要再去一趟徹底解決掉這個威脅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。當然，因為任務情況有變，需要重組任務成員，所以並不強制你們參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"都這麼說了，那我們哪有就這麼退出的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，好人做到底了。不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，你不是要去演唱會嗎，你就別去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，演唱會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，再過幾個小時就要開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊，那紅豆你就不用參加啦，先去演唱會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要參加任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不用啦，又不是什麼危險的任務，只是這群野獸多了個首領而已，我們幾個人可以解決的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不是你很喜歡的樂隊嗎，你放心去就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，雖然你有這份心是好事，不過真的不用擔心，你已經完成了上一個任務，只要安心去做你喜歡的事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主唱","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，準備好了嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾的呼喊聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"準備好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主唱","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今夜，將是個不眠之夜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"現場的氣氛果然跟隔著螢幕完全不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"真該拉他們也來體驗一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我就算了，對我來說，搖滾太吵鬧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我也差不多，不過為了我們紅豆的演唱會，我們兩個也努力一點吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，紅豆，你的演唱會來得及嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾A","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾B","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"別擠啊，小姑娘！你往外走幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"讓一讓，讓一讓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾C","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爆米花！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊，抱歉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，紅豆，你怎麼這麼早就回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說演唱會要持續一晚上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"他們人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"就是今天一起執行任務的那群傢伙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說，這群野獸真是狡猾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，看起來是意識到我們有威脅就躲起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，難怪能夠在這一帶肆虐這麼久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，要不要和其他小組說一下，回去多申請一些人手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"再找找吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"都在紅豆面前誇下海口了，現在就回去不是很丟人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，也對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，說到紅豆，說真的，紅豆真是個好姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前都沒見過像她這麼有活力的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛，你看不起薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，別亂講啊，在羅德島這麼久了，誰還會對薩卡茲有偏見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我對你可能是有偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙真是欠揍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行行行，我的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我也挺喜歡紅豆這丫頭的，不僅想拉我們一起去演唱會，而且聽說還有任務也想跟過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"她不只是有活力，而且已經有了責任感，這才是難得的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，能讓這樣的好孩子去做自己想做的事，也是我們努力的理由，所以別廢話了，趕緊繼續找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼感覺好話全被你說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？九點鐘方向有動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來像是在疾跑，兩個聲音，像是在追趕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是別的小隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我明明看到往這邊跑了，怎麼跟丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒找到其他人，好煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，紅豆，你怎麼來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你們在這裡啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到點動靜趕過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是應該去演唱會了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我不放心這邊，就跑回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，那也太浪費了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，踢我屁股幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你會不會說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，真的沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我已經和後勤那邊說過了，我感覺還是任務更加重要一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行，那你就還是和我們一組吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"話說紅豆你背著的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這是我的吉他，本來想拿去給人家簽名的，走得急，就直接帶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你小子去做一下追蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼是我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"說錯話的人沒人權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行行行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，我們走，爭取今晚把這群野獸拿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊，我找到它們的巢穴了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"給另外兩支小隊發個信號，一起進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野獸頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吼！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"看槍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野獸頭領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"解決了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"幹得漂亮，紅豆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這下應該是真的解決了，先在這裡休息一下，再搜索一下現場就回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好，紅豆，你也在這裡休息一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，你怎麼把你的吉他拿出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我不是說想讓你們也聽聽演唱會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然現在演唱會沒了，但我可以彈給你們聽聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那把其他人也喊過來吧，今天就是我們的大搖滾家，紅豆小姐的第一場演唱會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜，將是個不眠之夜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員B"]},{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["紅豆"]}]}
